1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,496
Bonjour ! Un billet pour Lyon, s'il vous plaît.
Hello! One ticket to Lyon, please.

2
00:00:05,996 --> 00:00:08,612
Aller simple ou aller-retour ?
One-way or round-trip?

3
00:00:09,112 --> 00:00:12,112
Aller-retour, s'il vous plaît.
Round-trip, please.

4
00:00:12,612 --> 00:00:14,508
Pour aujourd'hui ?
For today?

5
00:00:15,008 --> 00:00:18,752
Oui. À quelle heure part le train ?
Yes. What time does the train leave?

6
00:00:19,252 --> 00:00:21,724
Il part à quatorze heures.
It leaves at two p.m.

7
00:00:22,224 --> 00:00:24,096
De quel quai ?
From which platform?

8
00:00:24,596 --> 00:00:26,924
Du quai numéro trois.
From platform number three.

9
00:00:27,424 --> 00:00:31,432
Merci ! Je dois me dépêcher !
Thanks! I have to hurry!

10
00:00:31,932 --> 00:00:33,972
Bon voyage !
Have a good trip!

